used under the GNU Lesser General Public License 3; FFmpeg is copyright
the FFmpeg developers and used under the GNU Lesser General Public
License 2.1 or later (only its HEVC decoder is built in); dav1d, the AV1
decoder, is copyright VideoLAN and the dav1d authors and used under its
BSD licence. The licences are in Licence. LumenHEIF itself is copyright
(C) 2026 Andrew Youll and released under the MIT licence. Its source (in
Lumen's source, plugins.heif), the libheif, FFmpeg and dav1d sources it
was built from, and the changes made to them for RISC OS are published
with each release, so LumenHEIF can be rebuilt with changed versions of
the libraries.
